  m_Text: "VR MOVEMENT & INTERACTION:\n\n\u2022 WALKING: Push Left Thumbstick to walk continuously\n\u2022 TELEPORTING: Push Right Thumbstick Forward to aim arc at the floor, release to teleport\n\u2022 TURNING: Flick Right Thumbstick Left/Right to snap turn\n\u2022 PICK UP ITEMS: Grip Trigger on either hand\n\u2022 INTERACT: (A) Button or Right Trigger\n\u2022 VIEW / INSPECT: (X) Button or Left Stick Click\n\n(Keyboard: WASD to walk, hold 'T' to teleport, E to interact, P to pick)"
